  "worked_solution": "First, to get the minor of ${p}_{35}$, we remove the $3$rd row and $5$th column: \n\n$$\nP=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -8 & 2 & 1 & \u2217 \\\\ 3 & 5 & \\sqrt{13} & 0 & \u2217 \\\\ \u2217 & \u2217 & \u2217 & \u2217 & -4 \\\\ 4 & 8 & 3 & 8 & \u2217 \\\\ 11 & 3 & \\sqrt{2} & -9 & \u2217\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor is \n\n$$\n{M}_{35}=|\\begin{aligned}3 & -8 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 5 & \\sqrt{13} & 0 \\\\ 4 & 8 & 3 & 8 \\\\ 11 & 3 & \\sqrt{2} & -9\\end{aligned}|.\n$$\n\nNow, the cofactor of ${p}_{35}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}_{35} & =(-1)^{3+5}{M}_{35} \\\\  & ={M}_{35} \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & -8 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 5 & \\sqrt{13} & 0 \\\\ 4 & 8 & 3 & 8 \\\\ 11 & 3 & \\sqrt{2} & -9\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
